, ${x}_{2}$ and ${x}_{3}$ are free variables. From the first equation, we obtain ${x}_{1}=-4{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}.$ So, the general solution is\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-4{x}_{2}+{x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}]={x}_{2}[\\begin{aligned}-4 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+{x}_{3}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}],\\,{x}_{2},{x}_{3}\\in R.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the required basis is\n\n$$\nB=\\{[\\begin{aligned}-4 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\\}.\n$$"] ["question-7b9e6797-8ad6-50af-aa3b-75e9f9aa6e0e" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-3112cc9b-c99d-5760-8709-44ca37572265" :answer-field/id #uuid "3112cc9b-c99d-5760-8709-44ca37572265"] ["answer-f7b099a0-b60b-53de-9964-15d50b6188cc" :answer/id #uuid "f7b099a0-b60b-53de-9964-15d50b6188cc"] ["answer-f7b099a0-b60b-53de-9964-15d50b6188cc" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-f7b099a0-b60b-53de-9964-15d50b6188cc" :answer/value "\\{[\\begin{aligned}-4 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\\}"] ["answer-754b876d-1c1d-5fa2-8c8a-19930e540b4b" :answer/id #uuid "754b876d-1c1d-5fa2-8c8a-19930e540b4b"] ["answer-754b876d-1c1d-5fa2-8c8a-19930e540b4b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-754b876d-1c1d-5fa2-8c8a-19930e540b4b" :answer/value "\\{[\\begin{aligned}-4 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]\\}"] ["answer-e516614c-5556-5ad9-a091-72667d82e048" :answer/id #uuid "e516614c-5556-5ad9-a091-72667d82e048"] ["answer-e516614c-5556-5ad9-a091-72667d82e048" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-e516614c-5556-5ad9-a091-72667d82e048" :answer/value "\\{[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\\}"] ["answer-1d1456d1-c217-5333-894e-c3d90b3be143" :answer/id #uuid "1d1456d1-c217-5333-894e-c3d90b3be143"] ["answer-1d1456d1-c217-5333-894e-c3d90b3be143" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-1d1456d1-c217-5333-894e-c3d90b3be143" :answer/value "\\{[\\begin{aligned}